    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>4级 游击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 55；''重伤'' 27</span><span>''先攻'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 18，''强韧'' 18，''反射'' 16，''意志'' 16</span><span>''侦查'' +4</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7，攀爬 6</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">灵敏攀爬者</div>\n<div class=description>该大猩猩不会因攀爬而引发借机攻击。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}击打✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+9vs.AC<br>命中：2d6+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}奔跑击打✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该大猩猩快步或攀爬最多其速度一半的格数并在该移动中的任一时点使用击打。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}暴殴打✦充能 6{{$:/dnd/images/six}}</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该大猩猩对同一个目标使用两次击打。若两次攻击都命中，则目标倒地。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（大猩猩）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+11</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 19（+6）</span><span>''敏捷'' 15（+4）</span><span>''感知'' 14（+4）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 15（+4）</span><span>''智力'' 2（-2）</span><span>''魅力'' 8（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
